Contour cards lit like iOS Liquid Glass.

- The bevel line lights the edges facing the light and the ones facing away
  (both surfaces of a pane reflect it) and fades on the edges parallel to it:
  with the light at the top, a line along the top and bottom and none on the
  sides. On the reference the left and right rims are invisible.
- No inner bottom shadow on traced cards: the reference cards are lifted and
  light, never sunk.

diff --git a/src/Shaders.hpp b/src/Shaders.hpp
